      "id": 15788,
      "name": "Undead_Octopus",
      "username": "Undead_Octopus1",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/u/8e8cbc/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-10-19T20:11:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hey guys, long time player of SotM: The Video Game, first time poster. I've most likely played with alot of you via my ids of Undead 0ctopus or Reptilian Ghoul!</p>\n<p>I'm having some major issues and I know the team is busy with Vengance and what not so I didn't want to post here but when the new update dropped and these bugs were unfixed I realize I had to post. I'm having a major bug issue with my game, here is some information.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>No Music at all. Via Multiverse info tabs or in game enviroment sound. I do have full effect sound though. :broken_heart: </strong></h4>\n&nbsp;\n<ul>\n<li>I use an iPhone 5C with its current iOs update to play.</li>\n<li>I have all the DLC for the game including the foil pack.</li>\n<li>I have my music and effects turned all the way up.</li>\n<li>I do not have any other apps open on my phone.</li>\n<li>My mute switch on my phone is not toggled.</li>\n<li>All other downloaded apps/games give me both music and sound effects besides SotM: The Video Game.</li>\n<li>I have uninstalled all DLC and reinstalled.</li>\n<li>I have uninstalled the game and reinstalled via computer link.</li>\n<li><strong>Also whenever I hit the \"Skip\" reccomendation on someones turn it just keep looping the sound constantly.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n&nbsp;\n<p>This has been happening since the <strong>previous update and the current one didnt fix it.</strong>&nbsp;I really miss the music of Jean Marc, I go to all the listening parties you all have too so you can imagine my pain,&nbsp;the other stuff is just minor at this point. I hope I posted this is the correct section. I really enjoy your game and the players, keep up the good work GtG, hopefully you can help me out with this!</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:48:17.862Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
