      "raw": "Hey guys, long time player of SotM: The Video Game, first time poster. I&#39;ve most likely played with alot of you via my ids of Undead 0ctopus or Reptilian Ghoul!\n\nI&#39;m having some major issues and I know the team is busy with Vengance and what not so I didn&#39;t want to post here but when the new update dropped and these bugs were unfixed I realize I had to post. I&#39;m having a major bug issue with my game, here is some information.\n\n&nbsp;\n<h4><strong>No Music at all. Via Multiverse info tabs or in game enviroment sound. I do have full effect sound though. :broken_heart: </strong></h4>\n&nbsp;\n<ul><li>I use an iPhone 5C with its current iOs update to play.</li><li>I have all the DLC for the game including the foil pack.</li><li>I have my music and effects turned all the way up.</li><li>I do not have any other apps open on my phone.</li><li>My mute switch on my phone is not toggled.</li><li>All other downloaded apps/games give me both music and sound effects besides SotM: The Video Game.</li><li>I have uninstalled all DLC and reinstalled.</li><li>I have uninstalled the game and reinstalled via computer link.</li><li><strong>Also whenever I hit the &quot;Skip&quot; reccomendation on someones turn it just keep looping the sound constantly.</strong></li></ul>\n&nbsp;\n\nThis has been happening since the <u><strong>previous update and the current one didnt fix it.</strong></u>&nbsp;I really miss the music of Jean Marc, I go to all the listening parties you all have too so you can imagine my pain,&nbsp;the other stuff is just minor at this point. I hope I posted this is the correct section. I really enjoy your game and the players, keep up the good work GtG, hopefully you can help me out with this!",
